  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0101_4954ef9133e5.png\" style=\"width: 272px; height: 229px;\" /></p><p>Time for particle to meet <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sec</mi></math></p><p>Time taken by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;particle to reach ground&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sec</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p>"
